Model weights
-------------
The released CSG-Fusion checkpoint (csg_fusion.ckpt) is fine-tuned from the MASt3R checkpoint
MASt3R_ViTLarge_BaseDecoder_512_catmlpdpt_metric and is subject to its terms
(src/mast3r_src/CHECKPOINTS_NOTICE), which include the licenses of the datasets MASt3R was trained on.
It was trained on ScanNet++; check the ScanNet++ terms of use for your use case. Non-commercial use only.

The released csg_fusion_vggt.ckpt contains the weights of facebook/VGGT-1B (CC BY-NC 4.0) and is subject to its terms and
the VGGT License. It was trained on ScanNet++; check the ScanNet++ terms of use for your use case. Non-commercial use only.
